<div class="field-html-title"><h4><a href="/media/audio/eyes-earth-episode-3-national-land-cover-database" hreflang="en">Eyes on Earth - Episode 3 - The National Land Cover Database</a></h4>
<a href="/media/audio/eyes-earth-episode-3-national-land-cover-database" class="d-link" hreflang="en"><span class="hidden">Eyes on Earth - Episode 3 - The National Land Cover Database</span></a></div>
  Eyes on Earth - Episode 3 - The National Land Cover Database

<div class="field field--name--field-detailed-description field--type--text-long field--label--hidden">
    
      <div  class="field-detailed-description"><div class="tex2jax_process"><p>Sorting Landsat data into an accurate and reliable record of land cover in the United States is one of the most important jobs at EROS. This episode of Eyes on Earth explores the what, how, and why of the National Land Cover Database (NLCD).<br><br>
&nbsp;</p>
</div></div>
  
</div>

<div class="field field--name--field-attributions field--type--computed-string-long field--label--inline">
