    <div class="d-title-info">
      <div class="d-info">  <time datetime="2021-02-26T09:15:00Z">February 26, 2021</time>

</div>
      <h4 class="d-title">  Detecting Shrub Recovery in Sagebrush Steppe: Comparing Landsat-Derived Maps with Field Data on Historical Wildfires
</h4>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="d-teaser-body">
    
<div class="field field--name--field-intro field--type--text-long field--label--hidden">
  
      <div  class="field-intro">  <p>Sagebrush can be scarce after fires in a semiarid ecosystem and their paucity over vast burn areas creates challenges for detection by remote sensing...</p>

</div>
  
</div>

    <a href="/news/detecting-shrub-recovery-sagebrush-steppe-comparing-landsat-derived-maps-field-data-historical" class="green-link">Read Article</a><i class="fa fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
  </div>
