        <h4>
              <a href="/publications/comparison-nlcd-nwi-classifications-baldwin-and-mobile-counties-alabama">
        <span class="usa-sr-only usgs-screenreader-only">  Comparison of NLCD with NWI Classifications of Baldwin and Mobile Counties, Alabama
</span>
                Comparison of NLCD with NWI Classifications of Baldwin and Mobile Counties, Alabama

              </a>
          </h4>
    
<div class="field field--name--field-intro field--type--text-long field--label--hidden">
  
      <div  class="field-intro">  An assessment of the accuracy of National Land Cover Data 2001 as compared to National Wetlands Inventory mapping of Mobile and Baldwin Counties conducted by the U.S. Geological Survey&#039;s (USGS) National Wetlands Research Center (NWRC). Both classifications were checked against stratified randomly selected ground-based sites and with each other to compare the accuracy of the NLCD with NWI

</div>
  
</div>

        
    
    

    
